 management"}]},{"type":"h","text":"AI"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Generative AI fundamentals"},{"text":"NLP fundamentals"},{"text":"Semantic search"},{"text":"RAG"},{"text":"Document AI"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Useful tools to demonstrate"},{"type":"flow","items":["Koha","DSpace","Zotero","Excel","SQL","Power BI","Python"],"sep":"+"}]},{"heading":"Careers You Can Be Hired As","kind":"careers","blocks":[{"type":"h","text":"Direct entry-level possibilities"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Information Assistant"},{"text":"Library Assistant"},{"text":"Documentation Assistant"},{"text":"Information Services Assistant"},{"text":"Research Assistant"},{"text":"Digital Library Assistant"},{"text":"Repository Assistant"},{"text":"Cataloguing Assistant"},{"text":"Metadata Assistant"},{"text":"Documentation Executive"},{"text":"Information Executive"},{"text":"Knowledge Management Assistant"}]},{"type":"h","text":"With stronger skills/eligibility"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Information Officer"},{"text":"Documentation Officer"},{"text":"Information Specialist"},{"text":"Digital Library Specialist"},{"text":"Research Information Specialist"},{"text":"Knowledge Management Executive"},{"text":"Metadata Specialist"},{"text":"Digital Archivist"},{"text":"Records Management Executive"},{"text":"Research Data Assistant"},{"text":"Bibliometric Analyst"},{"text":"Information Analyst"}]},{"type":"note","label":"Important","text":"Exact eligibility for government, university, librarian, and senior information-service posts varies by recruitment notification and may require a recognised BLIS/MLIS or equivalent qualification, experience, NET/SET, or other prescribed criteria. The BA label alone should not be treated as sufficient for every professional library post."},{"type":"h","text":"What Employers May Test"},{"type":"h","text":"Information retrieval"},{"type":"p","text":"Find authoritative sources for a research question and explain why they are reliable."},{"type":"h","text":"Cataloguing"},{"type":"p","text":"Create a structured bibliographic record for a book."},{"type":"h","text":"Classification"},{"type":"p","text":"How would you classify and organise a large academic collection?"},{"type":"h","text":"Digital libraries"},{"type":"p","text":"What is an institutional repository?"},{"type":"h","text":"Metadata"},{"type":"p","text":"What is the difference between metadata and bibliographic data?"},{"type":"h","text":"Research support"},{"type":"p","text":"How would you help a researcher identify high-quality literature?"},{"type":"h","text":"Data"},{"type":"p","text":"Analyse library usage data and identify the most important trends."},{"type":"h","text":"AI"},{"type":"p","text":"How can semantic search improve traditional keyword-based information retrieval?"},{"type":"h","text":"Practical assignment"},{"type":"p","text":"Give the candidate:"},{"type":"p","text":"1,000 unstructured documents"},{"type":"p","text":"and ask them to:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Clean the data"},{"text":"Extract metadata"},{"text":"Categorise documents"},{"text":"Create searchable fields"},{"text":"Build a dashboard"},{"text":"Design an information-retrieval workflow"}]}]},{"heading":"Postgraduate Study in India","kind":"pg_india","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"For stronger career progression:"},{"type":"h","text":"Library & Information Science"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"MLIS / Master of Library & Information Science"},{"text":"Library and Information Science specialisations"},{"text":"Information Management"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Research & Information"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"MA/MSc Information Science"},{"text":"Knowledge Management"},{"text":"Digital Humanities"},{"text":"Archives and Records Management"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Technology"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"MSc Data Science"},{"text":"MSc Computer Science"},{"text":"Information Systems"},{"text":"Data Analytics"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Management"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"MBA Knowledge Management"},{"text":"MBA Information Systems"},{"text":"MBA Business Analytics"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Research"},{"type":"p","text":"For academic/research careers:"},{"type":"flow","items":["BLIS","MLIS","NET/SET where applicable","PhD"]}]},{"heading":"Study Abroad","kind":"abroad","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"Potential master's areas:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Library & Information Science"},{"text":"Information Science"},{"text":"Information Management"},{"text":"Knowledge Management"},{"text":"Digital Libraries"},{"text":"Archives & Records Management"},{"text":"Information Systems"},{"text":"Data Science"},{"text":"Digital Humanities"},{"text":"Information Architecture"},{"text":"Digital Curation"},{"text":"Research Data Management"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Strong international combinations include:"},{"type":"h","text":"Information Science + Data Analytics"},{"type":"p","text":"or"},{"type":"h","text":"Digital Libraries + AI/NLP"},{"type":"p","text":"or"},{"type":"h","text":"Information Management + Knowledge Management"}]},{"heading":"Career Progression","kind":"growth","blocks":[{"type":"flow","items":["Library / Information Intern","Information Assistant","Information Officer","Senior Information Officer","Information Specialist","Knowledge Management Manager","Information Services Manager","Head of Information Services","Chief Knowledge / Information Officer"]},{"type":"p","text":"An alternative technology-focused route:"},{"type":"flow","items":["Digital Library Assistant","Digital Library Specialist","Metadata / Information Specialist","Research Information Analyst","Knowledge Systems Specialist","AI / Information Retrieval Specialist","Knowledge & Information Architecture Lead"]},{"type":"h","text":"2040–2046 Career Evolution"},{"type":"p","text":"The Information Officer role is likely to move substantially from managing documents and answering information requests toward designing intelligent information systems."},{"type":"h","text":"Emerging roles"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"AI Information Specialist"},{"text":"Knowledge Graph Specialist"},{"text":"AI Knowledge Manager"},{"text":"Research Intelligence Analyst"},{"text":"Digital Curation Specialist"},{"text":"Information Governance Specialist"},{"text":"AI Search Specialist"},{"text":"Enterprise Knowledge Architect"},{"text":"Research Data Management Specialist"},{"text":"AI-Assisted Digital Archivist"},{"text":"Information Quality & AI Evaluation Specialist"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Future workflow"},{"type":"flow","items":["Documents","OCR / Document AI","Metadata Extraction","Classification","Knowledge Graph","Semantic Search","RAG / AI Assistant","Human Verification","Knowledge Intelligence"]},{"type":"p","text":"The human role remains important because AI-generated information needs source verification, metadata quality, provenance, copyright awareness, privacy protection, contextual interpretation, and information governance."},{"type":"h","text":"Recommended Final Skill Stack"},{"type":"h","text":"Core"},{"type":"flow","items":["Library & Information Science","Information Retrieval","Cataloguing","Classification"],"sep":"+"},{"type":"h","text":"Digital"},{"type":"flow","items":["Digital Libraries","Metadata","Repositories","Documentation Systems"],"sep":"+"},{"type":"h","text":"Data"},{"type":"flow","items":["Excel","SQL","Power BI","Python"],"sep":"+"},{"type":"h","text":"Research"},{"type":"flow","items":["Literature Review","Bibliometrics","Research Data Management","Academic Publishing"],"sep":"+"},{"type":"h","text":"Technology"},{"type":"flow","items":["Search Systems","APIs","Databases","OCR","NLP"],"sep":"+"},{"type":"h","text":"AI"},{"type":"flow","items":["Semantic Search","Embeddings","RAG","Document AI","Knowledge Graphs"],"sep":"+"},{"type":"h","text":"Professional"},{"type":"flow","items":["Communication","Research Support","Information Evaluation","Project Management","Information Governance"],"sep":"+"},{"type":"h","text":"Target Progression"},{"type":"h","text":"0–2 years"},{"type":"p","text":"Information Assistant → Information Officer / Documentation Executive"},{"type":"h","text":"2–5 years"},{"type":"flow","items":["Senior Information Officer","Information Specialist","Research Information Specialist"]},{"type":"h","text":"5–8 years"},{"type":"flow","items":["Knowledge Management Specialist","Digital Library Manager","Information Services Manager"]},{"type":"h","text":"8+ years"},{"type":"flow","items":["Head of Information Services","Knowledge Management Head","Chief Knowledge/Information Officer"]},{"type":"h","text":"Best overall strategy"},{"type":"p","text":"For this career, don't build a profile around traditional library operations alone."},{"type":"p","text":"Build:"},{"type":"flow","items":["BA/BLIS foundation","Digital Library","Metadata","Information Retrieval","SQL/Power BI/Python","Research Analytics","AI Search/RAG","Knowledge Management"]},{"type":"p","text":"That combination can move the student from a conventional Information Officer profile toward higher-value roles in digital libraries, research intelligence, knowledge management, information systems, and AI-powered information retrieval."}]}]}